><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727340/extras/f72eb30de44e87e40ea063003562c5b2.avif?t=1729743061\" /></div><br><br><i>Compelling story:</i><br>- Drives gameplay and exploration.<br><br><i>Unsettling atmosphere:</i><br>- Feel the suspense of not knowing what lies behind each door.<br><br><i>Meticulously detailed, hand drawn cut scenes:</i><br>- Original art brings scenes to life.<br><br><i>Thoroughly developed characters:</i><br>- Make decisions based on character actions and motives.<br><br><i>Heart-stopping chase sequences:</i><br>- Tread carefully.<br><br><i>A variety of engaging puzzles:</i><br>- Solve puzzles in order to progress as well as unlock secrets.",
    "short_description": "A pleasantly anticipated trip back home for the holidays becomes a nightmare for Catherine as a tragic accident leaves her unconscious. After coming to her senses, she realizes that something is dreadfully wrong. She must escape the doll factory she awoke in before it's too late.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
